          "authorAssociation": "COLLABORATOR",
          "state": "APPROVED",
          "body": "I changed to E_MAX and D_MAC in -21 so people don't have to remember to new random letters.\n2^59 is now a recommendations. Both of the general bounds\n\u2113 \u226a 2^(m - t) .\nE_MAX \u22c5 P_MAX \u22c5 8 / b + 3 \u22c5 D_MAX \u226a 2^(b/2)\n\nDetermines how close \u03b5 and \u03b4 are to 1 in the formula\nE(F) \u2248 \u03b4 \u22c5 \u03b5 \u22c5 v / 2^t\n\nThere is no single correct answers on how close to 1 they need to be. \nE_MAX \u22c5 P_MAX / 16 = 2^60 would also be ok.\n\nThe change to A_MAX \u2248 P_MAX / 2^4 improves \u03b5 with P still 2^16",
